[gd_scene format=3]

; Moves one variable: a Vector2i position component past the band an int32 slot round-trips.
; Godot wraps an INT literal to int32 (`T(_data._int)`), so 4294967496 is 200 and -4294966996 is 300.
; No other scene reads such a literal, so none shows a reader that refuses it. The linter reports the
; alteration as an error, so negative-fixtures.json lists this scene.

